{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "root",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🏛 企業應用架構模式\nPoEAA",
      "x": -160,
      "y": 2159,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**領域邏輯三選項**\nTransaction Script（程序式）／Domain Model（物件化）／Table Module",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 136
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**資料源二選一**\nActive Record（簡單）vs Data Mapper（乾淨但複雜）",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 176,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 136
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**分層**\n展現層／領域層／資料源層，各司其職",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 352,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 136
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-領域邏輯組織模式.md",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 608,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-物件關聯映射模式.md",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 758,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110
    },
    {
      "id": "l6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**① 領域邏輯 Domain Logic**\n- [[交易指令稿|交易指令稿 Transaction Script]]\n- [[領域模型|領域模型 Domain Model]]\n- [[表格模組|表格模組 Table Module]]\n- [[服務層|服務層 Service Layer]]",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 988,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 196
    },
    {
      "id": "l7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**② 資料源架構 Data Source Architectural**\n- [[表格資料閘道|表格資料閘道 Table Data Gateway]]\n- [[列資料閘道|列資料閘道 Row Data Gateway]]\n- [[主動記錄|主動記錄 Active Record]]\n- [[資料對應器|資料對應器 Data Mapper]]",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1304,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 196
    },
    {
      "id": "l8",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**③ 物件關聯行為 O-R Behavioral**\n- [[工作單元|工作單元 Unit of Work]]\n- [[識別對應|識別對應 Identity Map]]\n- [[延遲載入|延遲載入 Lazy Load]]",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1620,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 166
    },
    {
      "id": "l9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**④ 物件關聯結構 O-R Structural**\n- [[識別欄位|識別欄位 Identity Field]]\n- [[外鍵對應|外鍵對應 Foreign Key Mapping]]\n- [[關聯表對應|關聯表對應 Association Table Mapping]]\n- [[從屬對應|從屬對應 Dependent Mapping]]\n- [[內嵌值|內嵌值 Embedded Value]]\n- [[序列化大物件|序列化大物件 Serialized LOB]]\n- [[單表繼承|單表繼承 Single Table Inheritance]]\n- [[類別表繼承|類別表繼承 Class Table Inheritance]]\n- [[具象表繼承|具象表繼承 Concrete Table Inheritance]]\n- [[繼承對應器|繼承對應器 Inheritance Mappers]]",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1906,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 376
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**⑤ 物件關聯中繼資料 O-R Metadata**\n- [[中繼資料對應|中繼資料對應 Metadata Mapping]]\n- [[查詢物件|查詢物件 Query Object]]\n- [[儲存庫|儲存庫 Repository]]",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 2402,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 166
    },
    {
      "id": "l11",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**⑥ Web 表現層 Web Presentation**\n- [[模型-視圖-控制器|模型-視圖-控制器 Model View Controller]]\n- [[頁面控制器|頁面控制器 Page Controller]]\n- [[前端控制器|前端控制器 Front Controller]]\n- [[樣板視圖|樣板視圖 Template View]]\n- [[轉換視圖|轉換視圖 Transform View]]\n- [[兩步驟視圖|兩步驟視圖 Two Step View]]\n- [[應用控制器|應用控制器 Application Controller]]",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 2688,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 286
    },
    {
      "id": "l12",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**⑦ 分散式 Distribution**\n- [[遠端外觀|遠端外觀 Remote Facade]]\n- [[資料傳輸物件|資料傳輸物件 Data Transfer Object]]",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 3094,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 136
    },
    {
      "id": "l13",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**⑧ 離線並發 Offline Concurrency**\n- [[樂觀離線鎖|樂觀離線鎖 Optimistic Offline Lock]]\n- [[悲觀離線鎖|悲觀離線鎖 Pessimistic Offline Lock]]\n- [[粗粒度鎖|粗粒度鎖 Coarse-Grained Lock]]\n- [[隱含鎖|隱含鎖 Implicit Lock]]",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 3350,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 196
    },
    {
      "id": "l14",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**⑨ 會話狀態 Session State**\n- [[用戶端會話狀態|用戶端會話狀態 Client Session State]]\n- [[伺服器會話狀態|伺服器會話狀態 Server Session State]]\n- [[資料庫會話狀態|資料庫會話狀態 Database Session State]]",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 3666,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 166
    },
    {
      "id": "l15",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**⑩ 基礎模式 Base Patterns**\n- [[閘道|閘道 Gateway]]\n- [[對應器|對應器 Mapper]]\n- [[層超型|層超型 Layer Supertype]]\n- [[分離介面|分離介面 Separated Interface]]\n- [[登錄器|登錄器 Registry]]\n- [[值物件|值物件 Value Object]]\n- [[金錢|金錢 Money]]\n- [[特例|特例 Special Case]]\n- [[外掛|外掛 Plugin]]\n- [[服務樁|服務樁 Service Stub]]\n- [[記錄集|記錄集 Record Set]]",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 3952,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 406
    },
